.TH CAMERA_SET_BOUNDS 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
camera_set_bounds \- Clamp the camera so it never shows outside the given world rectangle (the level edges): for a tilemap, camera_set_bounds(&cam, 0, 0, map.w * map.tile, map.h * map.tile)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcamera.h\(dq
.BI "void camera_set_bounds(Camera *c, float x, float y, float w, float h);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clamp the camera so it never shows outside the given world rectangle (the level edges): for a tilemap, camera_set_bounds(&cam, 0, 0, map.w * map.tile, map.h * map.tile). Applied by camera_follow(); setting pos directly bypasses it. Pass a zero\-size rectangle to disable.
.SH MODULE
camera (src/engine/camera/camera.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR camera_follow (3),
.BR Tilemap (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
